Error [jet.ComputedFieldCycle]: Computed module fields form a cycle: FIRST -> SECOND -> THIRD -> FIRST
  --> tests/ui/module_values_read_each_other.jet:4:8
    |
  4 | FIRST: SECOND + 1
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Module-level comptime values must have a deterministic dependency order
 Fix: Break the cycle by making one value independent or by moving the shared computation into a pure function
